# Project Rules for AI Assistants

## Git & Identity Policy (MANDATORY)
- All git commits and contributions MUST be made exclusively under:
  - Name: Barış Berke Çetin
  - Email: brsberkectn@gmail.com
  - GitHub: https://github.com/brsbrkctn
- Never add any AI tools, assistants, or third-party bots as co-authors, commit authors, or committers.
- Never add "Co-authored-by:" trailers for AI tools.

## Documentation
- All README.md files must be written in English without an explicit Developer section.
- User-facing planning docs, tasks, and reports must be written in Turkish.
- Code comments and git commit messages must be in English.
